node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
deploy/
web-build/
# Unanchored on purpose: any directory called android/ or ios/ is generated
# output, wherever it turns up — the root Expo projects, and copies a config
# plugin stamps out (src/connections/google/native/android/, for one). Leaving
# these unanchored makes the rule fail safe: a generated native directory is
# ignored even in a location nobody thought to list.
#
# The one exception is a local Expo module, which has to keep its native
# sources at modules/<name>/android/ for autolinking to find them. Those are
# re-included below, and only those.
#
# Every other directory named android/ or ios/ that holds real source has to
# be re-included by name below. Nothing warns you when one is missed: the
# files stay tracked and `git status` stays clean, because the rules filter
# what gets uploaded to the builder rather than what git records. The symptom
# is a remote build failing to resolve a module that resolves fine locally.
# scripts/verify-ignored-sources.mts fails the verify suite if a tracked file
# is ever excluded again, so this list cannot silently fall behind.
android/
ios/
!modules/*/android/
!modules/*/ios/
!src/connections/android/

# The root Android project is committed so the native build is reproducible
# from the repository alone, rather than only from running the config plugins.
#
# Consequence worth knowing before changing this: EAS runs `expo prebuild` only
# when android/ is absent. With it committed the build is bare — the plugins in
# plugins/ no longer run on the builder, and this directory becomes the source
# of truth. Anything added by a plugin must be re-generated and committed, or
# it ships in neither place.
!/android/

# …but not its build output, caches, or machine-specific paths. local.properties
# holds the SDK location of whoever last built, which is wrong for everyone else.
/android/.gradle/
/android/build/
/android/app/build/
/android/app/.cxx/
/android/local.properties
/android/.idea/
/android/.kotlin/
*.log
.env
.DS_Store

# wrangler files
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
!.env.example
desktop.ini
bundletool-all.jar
kotleta552-release.jks
app.apks
application.aab